ative ag\",\"recommenders\":12,\"score\":13.0},{\"vid\":\"vK1DazRK_a0\",\"title\":\"Solving Problems the Clojure Way - Rafal Dittwald\",\"channel\":\"Clojure/north\",\"summary\":\"Rafal Dittwald's Clojure/north talk shows how to move from writing Java-style code in Clojure to thinking in data-driven, functional terms. He walks through a JavaScript example, refactoring imperative code step by step into a functional core.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN repeatedly recommends it as a fantastic demonstration of procedural, OOP and FP approaches to the same problem, and of functional core and imperative shell.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"functional programming in clojure\",\"categories\":[\"Functional programming\",\"Software architecture & design\",\"Testing, debugging & developer tools\"],\"tags\":[\"clojure\",\"data-driven programming\",\"functional core\",\"refactoring\",\"javascript\"],\"quote\":\"I urge you to watch this fantastic video which illustrates procedural, OOP(lite), and FP approaches to a sample problem\",\"recommenders\":10,\"score\":13.0},{\"vid\":\"wSF82AwSDiU\",\"title\":\"The great porn experiment | Gary Wilson | TEDxGlasgow\",\"channel\":\"TEDx Talks\",\"summary\":\"Gary Wilson's TEDxGlasgow talk argues that internet pornography hyperstimulates the brain's reward system and can cause symptoms that reverse when people stop. TED notes that several claims are not supported by respected academic studies.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters frequently recommend it as an eye-opening case against heavy porn use, though it is contested science.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"porn addiction\",\"categories\":[\"Mental health & neurodiversity\",\"Neuroscience & the brain\"],\"tags\":[\"dopamine\",\"addiction\",\"internet pornography\",\"neuroscience\",\"tedx\"],\"quote\":\"Here's an enlightening video on the detrimental effects of porn on the brain.\",\"recommenders\":10,\"score\":13.0},{\"vid\"