ical & precision engineering\"],\"tags\":[\"elevators\",\"physical security\",\"pen testing\",\"access control\",\"hacker conference\"],\"quote\":\"it was so interesting to me that I ended up watching the entire 2 hours in one sitting.\",\"recommenders\":9,\"score\":9.5},{\"vid\":\"ZmNOAtZIgIk\",\"title\":\"Bay Area Vision Meeting: Unsupervised Feature Learning and Deep Learning\",\"channel\":\"Google TechTalks\",\"summary\":\"Andrew Ng presents unsupervised feature learning and deep learning, showing how algorithms can learn representations from unlabeled data instead of hand-designed features. He gives examples in vision and audio, including visualizations of features learned by successive layers.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN commenters recommended it for years as a simple, exciting overview of the deep learning wave.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"unsupervised feature learning\",\"categories\":[\"Machine learning & deep learning\",\"Computer vision, speech & NLP\"],\"tags\":[\"deep learning\",\"andrew ng\",\"neural networks\",\"feature learning\",\"computer vision\"],\"quote\":\"he explains very simply how all this works for images and some examples about the audio case.\",\"recommenders\":9,\"score\":9.5},{\"vid\":\"biYciU1uiUw\",\"title\":\"Contrepreneurs: The Mikkelsen Twins\",\"channel\":\"Folding Ideas\",\"summary\":\"Dan Olson of Folding Ideas investigates the Mikkelsen Twins and the ghostwritten-audiobook passive-income course industry, even playing along with the scheme. It is a long video essay on get-rich-quick publishing grifts.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN links it whenever threads cover book spam, AI-written ebooks or passive-income hustle culture.\",\"content_type\":\"commentary\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"passive income scams\",\"categories\":[\"Gaming culture & analysis\",\"Media, journalism & propaganda\",\"Product, marketing & sales\"],\"tags\":[\"video essay\",\"book spam\",\"grifts\",\"audiobooks\",\"kindl