ote\",\"channel\":\"QuakeCon Official\",\"summary\":\"John Carmack's long QuakeCon 2012 keynote, a free-ranging talk covering software engineering, game platforms, game streaming, and his early head-mounted display and VR work.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN rates his QuakeCon keynotes among the best technical talks, and cites this one for the VR segment and for his views on Linux gaming.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"game development and vr\",\"categories\":[\"Tech pioneers & interviews\",\"Game programming & engines\",\"VR, AR & spatial computing\"],\"tags\":[\"john carmack\",\"quakecon\",\"virtual reality\",\"software engineering\",\"id software\",\"keynote\"],\"quote\":\"John Carmack did a pretty fascinating segment about his work on something to this effect\",\"recommenders\":6,\"score\":8.0},{\"vid\":\"yFIa-Mc2KSk\",\"title\":\"MountainWest RubyConf 2013 Devs and Depression by Greg  Baugues\",\"channel\":\"Confreaks\",\"summary\":\"Greg Baugues tells his story of living with bipolar II and ADHD as a developer at a Ruby conference. He urges openness about mental illness and explains how to get help and support colleagues.\",\"why_hn\":\"Repeatedly recommended in mental health threads for its honest storytelling that resonates with developers.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"developer mental health\",\"categories\":[\"Mental health & neurodiversity\",\"Software practice, open source & careers\"],\"tags\":[\"depression\",\"bipolar\",\"adhd\",\"developers\",\"burnout\"],\"quote\":\"I recommend this talk about depression and software developers: There are newer versions of this talk, but I think this one has the most powerful storytelling.\",\"recommenders\":7,\"score\":8.0},{\"vid\":\"y_SXXTBypIg\",\"title\":\"The Truth about American Cities - Part 1 - Strong Towns [ST01]\",\"channel\":\"Not Just Bikes\",\"summary\":\"The first video in Not Just Bikes' Strong Towns series explains the financial 